  internalName: city
  externalName: PARCEL CITY
  description: THE BUSTLING UPTOWN CENTER OF THE ISLAND'S CAPITAL (AND ONLY) CITY.
    A MUST-SEE FOR MAIL-LOVERS
  openingHeadline: BREAKING NEWS - local delivery service hires new driver, somehow
    a headlining story.
  headlines:
  - local resident creates website to track the number of cones knocked over by delivery
    drivers - "leavetheconesalone.org"
  - local rodent community celebrates destruction of bins.
  - "council spends \u20AC9.8 million on new benches across the city, hopefully nobody
    knocks them over or anything."
  - fire department switches to water balloons after shortage of hydrants - "it makes
    fires way more exciting".
  - '"there''s no knocking down my trees", boasts park gardener.'
  - '"kfg ipsiufbgpu989-jnu", says cat who walked across writer''s keyboard.'
  - the average cosumer now expects their package to be delivered in thirty seconds.
  - scientists attempt to explain the high volume of glowing yellow spots around
    the city.
  - '"it''s a feature" says game developer in response to what is clearly a bug.'
  - study concludes in-universe news mechanic serves "no real use, honestly."
